        "category": "offensive",
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The Hazard is triggered.</p><hr /><p>The Queen of Alatar releases a magical blast charged with the energy of emotions, dealing @Damage[4d10+22] damage to all creatures in a @Template[cone|distance:30] with a @Check[reflex|dc:29|basic] Save, then escapes from combat, leaving the party to fight with her soldiers.</p><p>On a Failure, any targeted creature is also affected by a secondary condition based on her current emotion:</p><ul><li><p>Happiness: 2nd-rank @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.r8g7oSumKOHDqJsd]{Agitate} for 1 round.</p></li><li><p>Sadness: Unable to use Reactions for 1 round.</p></li><li><p>Fear: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}</p></li><li><p>Disgust: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}</p></li></ul>"
        },
